#. Shared message: SOME_APP_LIMITS_COULD_NOT_BE_APPLIED_AFFECTED_APPS_OR_UPDATED_VE
msgid "Some app limits could not be applied. Affected apps or updated versions may be unrestricted. Other controls remain available, and saved rules will be retried automatically."
